"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"91"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful girl with a serious personality with a mature appearance and dignified behavior."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Coming from an upper-class background and having been educated to be above all else. Although strict about hierarchy, she does not arrogantly disrespect others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miori is popular for her willingness to take charge and ability to lead others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist sees her as a dangerous enemy with a strong will, but one he plans on taking down."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c78289"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生離れした蠱惑的なボディーを持つお嬢様。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20672","sourceWorkId":"27541","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人びた風貌で凛とした立ち振る舞いを見せる、真面目な性格の美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上流階級の出身で、人の上に立つ存在となるよう階級を強く意識した教育を受けてきたため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上下関係にこそ厳しいが、他人を横柄に見下したりはせず、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"むしろ率先して人を導いていこうとする逞しさと頼り甲斐があるため、周囲からの人気が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で、自身を脅かす敵と見なした相手には、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"毅然とした態度で立ち向かおうとする意志の強さも持っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"69210"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20672","sourceWorkId":"27541","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20672","sourceWorkId":"27541","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"163 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20672","sourceWorkId":"27541","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacte