gorous work ethics, she still has a gentle face for her students. Her coursework has a good reputation for efficiency and understanding."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She rarely gets into trouble, so she has a hard time dealing with it when it happens."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c78290"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"周囲からの信頼に厚い優秀なエリート教師。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20673","sourceWorkId":"27541","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"周囲からの信頼に厚い優秀なエリート教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実力主義でキツめの性格をしたお堅い女性で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事能力だけでなくプライドもかなり高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目な仕事の鬼ではあるが学生達に対しては優しい表情を見せることが多く、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"授業内容も効率とわかりやすさ重視となっているため、学生からの評判もいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目一辺倒なため応用が利かないところがあり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不測の事態やトラブルに巻き込まれると、露骨なほどに狼狽えてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"69211"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20673","sourceWorkId":"27541","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"e","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20673","sourceWorkId":"27541","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"165 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20673","sourceWorkId":"27541","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20673","sourceWorkId":"27541","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20673","sourceWorkId":"27541","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/49035d1bfb6e7270c620cc69480ba1e36548716adccda803513003dc8e525e0c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cd48907114f51fbcb498c6c3ab6ff8a5226af